@sheet Data
-Revenue-Cost-
| 300 | 120 |
| 260 | 110 |
| 440 | 200 |

@sheet Stage1
-Metric-Value-
| Revenue | =SUM(!!Revenue) |
| Cost | =SUM(!!Cost) |
| Gross | =B2-B3 |

@sheet Stage2
-Metric-Value-
| MarginPct | =Stage1!B4/Stage1!B2 |
| Gate | =IF(B2>0.5,"GO","HOLD") |

@sheet Board
-Label-Value-
| *Gross* | =Stage1!B4 |
| _Margin_ | =Stage2!B2 |
| ~~Gate~~ | =Stage2!B3 |
